o make sure that US companies are  not engaged in providing the resources  and the wherewithal to allow the Chinese  to oppress its own people now gold chera  did meet last week with Secretary of  State Pompeo but the lawmakers who  authored this letter say words aren't  enough they want inspectors allowed into  the camps and they want to make sure US  companies aren't selling surveillance  technology to China to help them with  these abuses Gayle all right Margaret  thank you very much
 

